## Overview

| | |
| --- | --- |
| **Base URL** | `https://api.example.com` |
| **Auth** | Bearer token |
| **Format** | JSON, UTF-8 |

## Endpoints

:::api{method=GET path="/v1/items" auth="bearer token"} List items
| Query | Type | Required | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `limit` | integer | no | 1–100, default 20 |
| `cursor` | string | no | From the previous page |

**Responses:** `200` page of items
:::

:::api{method=POST path="/v1/items" auth="bearer token"} Create an item
| Field | Type | Required | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `name` | string | yes | 1–80 characters |

**Responses:** `201` created · `422` validation errors (all fields at once)
:::

## Errors

| Status | Meaning | Retry? |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `401` | Missing or invalid token | No |
| `429` | Rate limited | Yes, after `Retry-After` |
| `5xx` | Server error | Yes, with backoff |

## Changelog

:::timeline
- **{{today}}** — v1 draft
:::

:::agent Rules for API changes
- Every endpoint needs an OpenAPI entry and a contract test.
- Never remove or rename a field in v1; add new fields instead.
:::
